254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (     The goal of this user manual is to ensure that every user can efficiently and effectively manage reservations, from initial booking to check-out. We aim to simplify the reservation process and enhance the overall guest experience at Villa Gilda Resort. This manual will cover a wide range of topics, including system navigation, booking procedures, modifying and canceling reservations, and generating reports. )
/E (     The goal of this user manual is to ensure that every user can efficiently and effectively manage reservations, from initial booking to check-out. We aim to simplify the reservation process and enhance the overall guest experience at Villa Gilda Resort. This manual will cover a wide range of topics, including system navigation, booking procedures, modifying and canceling reservations, and generating reports. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (      This user manual is intended for all personnel involved in the reservation process at Villa Gilda Resort, including the administrator and staff. It is also a valuable resource for new employees who need to quickly get up to speed with our reservation system. By following the guidelines and instructions provided, users at all levels will be able to deliver exceptional service and maintain the high standards of Villa Gilda Resort.)
/E (      This user manual is intended for all personnel involved in the reservation process at Villa Gilda Resort, including the administrator and staff. It is also a valuable resource for new employees who need to quickly get up to speed with our reservation system. By following the guidelines and instructions provided, users at all levels will be able to deliver exceptional service and maintain the high standards of Villa Gilda Resort.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
