/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (   The Villa Gilda Resort Reservation System is a web-based tool developed to streamline the management of reservations for the resort. This user manual is designed to assist staff and administrators in efficiently handling all aspects of the reservation process.    As the assigned personnel for managing reservations, staff and administrators have to ensure the smooth operation of the resort's booking system. The website facilitates this by providing various features specifically for reservation management and administrative needs.)
/E (   The Villa Gilda Resort Reservation System is a web-based tool developed to streamline the management of reservations for the resort. This user manual is designed to assist staff and administrators in efficiently handling all aspects of the reservation process.    As the assigned personnel for managing reservations, staff and administrators have to ensure the smooth operation of the resort's booking system. The website facilitates this by providing various features specifically for reservation management and administrative needs.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
