291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (  Only authorized users can access the system. Before entering the website, users \(admin/staff\) are required to input their registered email and password. When adding staff, the system ensures they are assigned a strong password by enforcing validation that the password must contain special characters, numbers, and be 8 or more characters long. For added security while logging in, the password field includes a hide/unhide option.)
/E (  Only authorized users can access the system. Before entering the website, users \(admin/staff\) are required to input their registered email and password. When adding staff, the system ensures they are assigned a strong password by enforcing validation that the password must contain special characters, numbers, and be 8 or more characters long. For added security while logging in, the password field includes a hide/unhide option.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
