297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (  The system offers real-time updates, helping both the admin and staff to manage reservations efficiently. They can see the latest available and reserved dates directly on the calendar, with any changes appearing instantly. This feature prevents double bookings and ensures smooth operations. The admin can quickly add, change, or cancel bookings, keeping all information accurate. Additionally, real-time data helps create up-to-date reports on reservations and occupancy, supporting better decision-making.)
/E (  The system offers real-time updates, helping both the admin and staff to manage reservations efficiently. They can see the latest available and reserved dates directly on the calendar, with any changes appearing instantly. This feature prevents double bookings and ensures smooth operations. The admin can quickly add, change, or cancel bookings, keeping all information accurate. Additionally, real-time data helps create up-to-date reports on reservations and occupancy, supporting better decision-making.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
