/Pg 10 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (  The system is designed with portability in mind, ensuring it can be accessed and managed from various devices and locations. It is compatible with desktops, laptops, tablets, and smartphones, allowing users to manage reservations on the go. The responsive design adapts to different screen sizes and resolutions, providing a smooth experience across all devices.  It is highly portable, offering flexibility and convenience for both the admin and staff.)
/E (  The system is designed with portability in mind, ensuring it can be accessed and managed from various devices and locations. It is compatible with desktops, laptops, tablets, and smartphones, allowing users to manage reservations on the go. The responsive design adapts to different screen sizes and resolutions, providing a smooth experience across all devices.  It is highly portable, offering flexibility and convenience for both the admin and staff.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [29]
>>
