/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (   The Villa Gilda Resort reservation system allows users to manage and schedule reservations using a visual calendar interface. It provides a user-friendly way to view, manage, and book reservations based on the availability of dates. It replaces traditional booking methods with an interactive calendar that shows real-time availability and allows users to make bookings directly through it. )
/E (   The Villa Gilda Resort reservation system allows users to manage and schedule reservations using a visual calendar interface. It provides a user-friendly way to view, manage, and book reservations based on the availability of dates. It replaces traditional booking methods with an interactive calendar that shows real-time availability and allows users to make bookings directly through it. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
