/S /H3
/T (The dashboard, accessible exclusively to the admin, provides detailed insights into the resort's operations. It displays key metrics such as the total number of reservations, available dates, earnings, pending payments, and the number of pending payments, which can be viewed for any selected month. Additionally, the dashboard includes graphical representations, such as charts for time slots showing popular reservation times and a monthly sales chart. It also offers a comprehensive view of the resort's annual earnings, enabling strategic decision-making and financial planning based on clear data.)
